#passage(("If He says to me and you, you should pray, then we need to pray; if he says don't do this, then we don't do it. It's the objective Truth. So we need to know what is from God then, because Truth is important. If God is the objective Truth and what he commands is objectively true, then if someone claims to be a Messenger of God, and he isn't, then I'm not following God, I'm actually following the opposite of what God says. If I've put someone else in God's position, I've made that person in God's position. Joseph Smith have completely renovated the teachings and the beliefs, and what you should do, what you shouldn't do, the planets that people will have, and all of these different beliefs that are not part of Christianity. So if that person is not from God, then these teachings are not from God. Then for you to believe them and follow them, that means you're opposing God, because you're following a man over the teachings of God.", "And the same thing goes for Prophet Muhammadﷺ. That's what I'm telling you: you need evidences. Once we establish with evidences he's a Prophet of God, then this becomes objective Truth, and we follow it; we cannot pick and choose. Allah says in the Quran that the Jews and the Christians, that's what they do. Allah says: أَفَتُؤۡمِنُونَ بِبَعۡضِ ٱلۡكِتَـٰبِ وَتَكۡفُرُونَ بِبَعۡضࣲۚ \"Do you believe in parts of the Scriptures and disbelieve in parts of the Scriptures?\" (Albaqarah2:85) You pick and choose, cherry-pick in a way, what you like you follow, and what you don't like you don't follow? God is saying you cannot pick and choose from my teachings, my commands, they come holistically as one package, because it's the Guidance of God, and you need to follow it holistically, the way it's taught, in order for you to achieve Eternal Life, in order for you to achieve salvation and bliss. That's why I'm sharing with you today: you need to investigate whether the Prophet Muhammadﷺ is the Messenger of God or not, and once you do, then you need to follow him, because now he's a Prophet of God.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Mormon Questions Muslim On His Beliefs! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V9ahapVJr5I", ((717, "11:57–12:39"), (762, "12:42–13:24"),), id: 915)
