#passage(("So the Quran, we know, is preserved 100%, because we memorize the whole Quran by memory from the time of the Prophet, millions of people. It has not been changed, but, for example, the Bible has been changed. Even if you open different Bibles, the same verse will say different things. So it will say different things about God, because they will say to you: the old manuscript has some different things, and these manuscripts have different things. It's not been preserved. The Quran has been preserved, written format and also orally.", "The Quran talks about the things that we're learning today; talks about, for example, the biological life is from water. All biological life: we're learning that today, that everything is from cells, and cells are 60 to 70% water. Quran talks about the universe expanding. We learned in the 1900s by Hubble Telescope. It talks about the baby in the mother's womb developing a stage by stage.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheists Challenge Muslim On The Existence of God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FZsW9t6W52Q", ((1185, "19:45–21:15"), (1301, "21:41–22:00"),), id: 944)
