#passage(("So these are enough criteria so far to, in reality, in my opinion, exclude every religion other than Islam, any religion you can mention to me, even though I didn't even give you the entire criteria, but what I've given you so far. So easily you can use this to debunk the overwhelming majority or all the religions except Islam.", "Now the most important and the last remaining criteria is that that religion has to have proof that it is from God. What does that mean? Something you and me cannot do. Because can I write a book now and say it's from God? Yes, I can. Can I write a book now that has no contradictions? I can easily. So I can do these things. Can I write a book now that is preserved? Yeah, we have here today [ChatGPT], computers, whatever. It's very easy to preserve now, in comparison to that time. So all of these criterias are not enough. I need to be able to produce or do something that you, me and every other human being sitting here is unable to do, not only today, until the day of judgment. I have to be able to do something that nobody is able to replicate. And that's the definition, you can say, of what we call miracle: something that no other human being is able to replicate and imitate.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “How Do You Know Which Religion Is From God? A Detailed Comprehensive Analysis | The Muslim Lantern”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9F5gS1yWIRI", ((1718, "28:38–28:57"), (1740, "29:00–30:08"),), id: 946)
