#passage(("There isn't any other religion today that can offer the same evidence, that can offer multiple prophecies of the future: clear, specific prophecies, specifically saying countries or a time frame, numerous, none of which are false; a religion that has a scripture that is preserved: you're not going to find a single religion like this today. And anyone is welcome to prove me wrong. I've been looking for that for a long time. There isn't, because I've already read the Bible, I've already looked at the Torah, I've already looked at the Talmud, I've already looked at the Bhagavad Gita, the Vedas, I've already looked at different Hindu scriptures. Nobody has that. Do you know what they have? They have false prophecies of the future, things which did not happen. So, that is a problematic thing.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Refuses To Accept Rational Evidences For Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KFpgNsX6nJ4", ((473, "7:53–8:51"),), id: 948)
