#passage(("For instance, we have evidence as prophecies of the future: things that the Prophetﷺ told us are going to happen, that happened in his life, that happened 100s of years after him, that happened today. And heﷺ existed 1,400 years ago. And not a single prophecy of these are false. There's specific prophecies, clear prophecies. Many of them are time bound, individual bound, people bound, etc. And they all actualise exactly the way the Prophetﷺ told us they will actualise. And that is not in the capacity of any human being.", "Another category of evidence is the Quran's description of the natural life. The Quran talks about, for example, life and how the universe is; it talks about mountains, it talks about stars, it talks about the human being, the embryo, it talks about water, it talks about plants, it talks about clouds, all of these things. And the information within the Quran, all of it is not only accurate, but it contains information that we only learned in the recent times using our technology, which the Prophetﷺ could not have known, which demonstrates that this knowledge comes from the One Who created that world; He knows what the world is because He created the world. So this information not only did not exist in previous Scriptures, but we are only learning about them today.", "Another category of evidence is the Quran's mentions of history. It mentions certain historical facts that were not present at the time of the Prophetﷺ (peace and blessings be upon him), and it did not exist in previous Scriptures, for example, the Hindu Scripture or the Christian Scripture or the Jewish Scripture. And it's not only that, but you couldn't access it, because the information, for example, was based on a dead language, or was in a temple that was buried, or a language that we couldn't read. But the Quran mentions all of these knowledge that are unique to the Quran. And we know today, through the discoveries of all of these historical artefacts, that this information is true.", "Another example is studying the life of the Prophet himself. If you psychologically study his life and look at what he taught and what he did, you will come to the absolute conclusion that he could not have been doing this for any other reason except being a Messenger of God. I can give a huge list of evidences, but these are some of the categories of what we would present as objectively rational evidences to why Islam must be the Truth, without any doubt.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Tactically Turns The Tables On A Christian! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=miaGqA6AFCs", ((143, "2:23–2:52"), (175, "2:55–3:40"), (226, "3:46–4:26"), (268, "4:28–4:55"),), id: 1020)
