#passage(("Why Islam? Because Islam is the Truth. It's the Absolute Truth. There is no doubt that Islam is the only religion that can be established, using rationality and objective evidence, common sense, that it is a religion that comes from God. Other religions have been manipulated; their scriptures have been manipulated. They have contradictions, internal and external, i.e, the text contradicts itself or contradicts reality. The religions themselves do not have any objective proof to offer that they are from God, when you ask them, other than their personal experience and fuzzy feelings and dreams when they're sleeping at night. There isn't any objective evidence that they can offer other people, and justifications for their belief.", "If anything else was the Truth, I would be believing in that. So, it's not that I just happen to believe in Islam. No, I believe in Islam because, after investigation, that was the Truth. So, that is the choice that I stuck with.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Refuses To Accept Rational Evidences For Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KFpgNsX6nJ4", ((58, "0:58–1:35"), (101, "1:41–1:52"),), id: 1021)
