#passage(("That's the difference between Islam and Christianity: we don't have a problem in highlighting the evidences for why Islam is the truth. The Quran has knowledge of the world, and it doesn't have false information, unlike other scriptures. So, the evidences for Islam are so many, and due to that, Islam stands in a clear light and everything else is in darkness. That's why Allah says in the Quran: the Jewish people and the Christian people said at the time of the prophet Muhammad, \"You will only enter paradise if you're a Jew or a Christian.\" Then Allah says in the Quran, \"Produce your proof if you're truthful.\" This is where everything comes to: who has proof to produce that what they have is from God. If you don't have proof to produce that what you have is from God, then, Allah says, this is their wishful thinking. It's just wishful thinking.", "So, why would I not follow the Quran, which I have proof is from God, is preserved and doesn't have contradictions? Of course I will. If a book is changed, it's not now reliable historically, it's contradictory, of course I'm not going to accept everything that it says.", "The Jewish people don't even try to bring you into Judaism, because they'll tell you have to be born as one.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Niqabi Challenges the Continuity of Islam with Previous Scriptures! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7-kSmD09rxI", ((1846, "30:46–32:18"), (1949, "32:29–32:44"), (1984, "33:04–33:07"),), id: 1025)
