bes many of these people, how they know the Truth, but they still deny the Truth.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Atheist Disproves The Quran?! Is Ezra The Son Of God? Islam Predates Judaism|”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_RrmYKq0qU", ((2136, "35:36–36:08"), (2174, "36:14–36:39"), (2205, "36:45–37:33"),), id: 1121)
