#passage(("One day a person was here from Syria, Levantine. And he is pale, his skin is pale, and he's standing with us, and two English people, who were drunk, said: \"what are you doing with them? You're one of us!?\" They got this perception, they think that a Muslim is an Arab, or a Muslim is Asian, but a Muslim is a Muslim; you can be from any background. 80% are Muslim non-Arabs, only 20% are Arabs. The biggest population of Muslims are non-Arabs, and that shows that this religion has nothing to do with being an Arab or not being an Arab.", "The Quran teaches you that the Prophet Muhammad is the Messenger to everyone, that he is a mercy to all mankind. This book is a mercy, a guidance for humanity. I don't think you're gonna really find any other messenger in history that he claimed to be for everyone. Moses didn't claim that, Jesus didn't claim that, Abraham didn't claim that. But Prophet Muhammad did claim that!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Ex-British Soldier Accepts Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MpAukyAbS_4", ((702, "11:42–12:39"), (766, "12:46–13:07"),), id: 1176)
